CRITICAL INTEGRATION RULES:
1. All POST requests: Content-Type: application/json
2. Protected routes: Authorization: Bearer <token>
3. Token stored: localStorage key "dsa_token"
4. User type stored: localStorage key "dsa_user_type"
5. Weak area scores: send as 0-1 NOT 0-100
6. On 401: clear localStorage + redirect /login
7. Diagnostic: never store questions, only results
8. mustResetPassword: redirect to /reset-password

